  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n** [Second term × (Second term - 1) × 3] + 1 = First term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given series:\n\n__91 : 6__ :: ? : 7 :: 169 : 8\n\n[6 × __**(6 - 1)**__ × 3] + 1 = 91\n\n__**[6 × 5 × 3]**__ + 1 = 91\n\n__**90 + 1**__ = 91\n\n91 = 91 \n\n91 : 6 :: ? : 7 :: __169 : 8__\n\n[8 × __(8 - 1)__ × 3] + 1 = 169\n__[8 × 7 × 3]__ + 1 = 169\n__168 + 1__ = 169\n169 = 169\n\n91 : 6 :: __? : 7__ :: 169 : 8\n\n[7 × __(7 - 1)__ × 3] + 1 = ?\n__[7 × 6 × 3]__ + 1 = ?\n__126 + 1__ = ?\n**127 = Answer**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**option (3)\".**",
